{"id":"663447","name":"梅干菜烧饼","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/663447/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"180克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"80克"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"先来调一下油酥玉米油100克+100面粉。","img":"images/663447/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加4克盐，10克辣椒粉。","img":"images/663447/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/663447/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油酥就好了。","img":"images/663447/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克面粉加2克盐。","img":"images/663447/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入180克温水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663447/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下手揉成光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜松弛30分钟以上。","img":"images/663447/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"梅干菜提前泡发。","img":"images/663447/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"剁碎。","img":"images/663447/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅烧油，下入梅干菜炒香，加入生抽，老抽，蚝油调味。","img":"images/663447/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"猪肉打成末。","img":"images/663447/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入超好的梅干菜。","img":"images/663447/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663447/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入葱花。","img":"images/663447/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再次搅拌均匀，馅料就好了。","img":"images/663447/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"松弛好的面团分成8等分。","img":"images/663447/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"取出一个面挤子，擀成长面片，尽量擀长。","img":"images/663447/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放上油酥，抹匀。","img":"images/663447/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"从一端卷起来。","img":"images/663447/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"收口压在下面。","img":"images/663447/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"捏紧。","img":"images/663447/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"按扁。","img":"images/663447/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"擀成薄的圆面片。","img":"images/663447/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"烤箱200度，烤10分钟。","img":"images/663447/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/663447/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"焦香酥脆，超级好吃。","img":"images/663447/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"也可以用电饼铛煎至两面金黄(不要放油哦)。","img":"images/663447/step_27.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}